---
import SocialLinks from '@components/site/contact/SocialLinks.astro';
import EmailCopy from '@components/site/contact/EmailCopy.astro';
---

<div class="biography">
  <p>
    I'm Haikhal Roywendra, an Information Systems student in Indonesia with a
    background in computer and network engineering. My studies connect software
    development with business systems, while my work spans web applications and
    cloud infrastructure. I'm also deepening my DevOps skills.
  </p>
  <p>
    As a freelance full-stack developer, I've built web and decentralized
    applications, working across frontend interfaces, backend systems, APIs,
    databases, and blockchain-based features. Before that, I interned as a
    computer technician at Epro Tech, servicing computers and printers and
    helping customers choose computer parts and networking equipment.
  </p>
  <p>
    Outside of code, I game and tinker with homelabbing. I use leftover
    networking gear from an internet café I used to run, keeping that interest
    in computers and networks going beyond my coursework and development
    projects.
  </p>
</div>

<nav class="about-contact" aria-label="Contact and social profiles">
  <SocialLinks />
  <EmailCopy />
</nav>

<style>
  .about-contact {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .about-contact :global(.social-links) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .biography > p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
